1          /*===============================================================================
2           * sdtm_epoch_bug_upperbound.sas - Bug regression: event after last SEENDTC mapped
3           *===============================================================================
4           * Macro under test : %sdtm_epoch
5           * Expected         : an event start after the last SEENDTC has no EPOCH because
6           *                    the documented rule requires the date to be on/after SESTDTC
7           *                    and prior to SEENDTC
8           * Status           : OPEN
9           * Original defect  : the matching condition is only "SESTDTC <= event start";
10          *                    SEENDTC is never used, so any later date keeps the last EPOCH
11          * Test passes when the defect is fixed (run_all then reports FIXED)
12          *============================================================================*/
